@startuml
!include style.puml
!pragma layout smetana

title Student archive lifecycle

state Active
state Archived

[*] --> Active
Active --> Archived : archive INDEX\ncopy all fields; archived = true
Archived --> Active : unarchive INDEX\ncopy all fields; archived = false
Active --> [*] : delete INDEX\npermanent
Archived --> [*] : delete INDEX\npermanent

note right of Active
  Included in list, find, and filter.
end note

note right of Archived
  Shown by list archived.
  All record fields remain stored.
end note

@enduml
